    println(hexDashInvalid)
    // null
}","title":"What's new in Kotlin 2.3.0","source":"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/whatsnew23.html","sections":["What's new in Kotlin 2.3.0 > Standard library > Improved UUID generation and parsing > Support for returning null when parsing invalid UUIDs"],"line_start":620,"line_end":656,"score":0.5564396381378174,"release_version":"2.3.0","availability":"See individual feature status in source; release version is not a snippet compatibility guarantee."}]}

